1
00:04:22,222 --> 00:04:28,222
Worlds collide.

2
00:08:44,444 --> 00:08:50,444
Percy Jackson & the Olympians: The Lightning Thief is a adventure,
fantasy, family film directed by Chris Columbus.

3
00:13:06,666 --> 00:13:12,666
Accident prone teenager, Percy discovers he's actually a demi-God, the son of
Poseidon, and he is needed when Zeus' lightning is stolen.

4
00:17:28,888 --> 00:17:34,888
Percy must master his new found skills in order to prevent a war
between the Gods that could devastate the entire world.

5
00:21:51,111 --> 00:21:57,111
Percy Jackson, played by Logan Lerman.

6
00:26:13,333 --> 00:26:19,333
Grover Underwood, played by Brandon T. Jackson.

7
00:30:35,555 --> 00:30:41,555
Annabeth Chase, played by Alexandra Daddario.

8
00:34:57,777 --> 00:35:03,777
Luke Castellan, played by Jake Abel.

9
00:39:20,000 --> 00:39:26,000
Mr. Brunner / Chiron, played by Pierce Brosnan.

10
00:43:42,222 --> 00:43:48,222
Zeus, played by Sean Bean.

11
00:48:04,444 --> 00:48:10,444
Percy Jackson & the Olympians is a fantasy novel
series by American author Rick Riordan.

12
00:52:26,666 --> 00:52:32,666
It is the first of four book series in the Camp Half-Blood Chronicles, preceding The
Heroes of Olympus, The Trials of Apollo, and The Nico di Angelo Adventures.

13
00:56:48,888 --> 00:56:54,888
The novels are set in a world with the Greek gods in the 21st century.

14
01:01:11,111 --> 01:01:17,111
The series follows the protagonist, Percy Jackson, a young demigod who must
prevent the Titans, led by Kronos, from destroying the world.

15
01:05:33,333 --> 01:05:39,333
The first three books were published in the United States by Miramax Books before they
were folded into Hyperion Books; that house published the remaining books.

16
01:09:55,555 --> 01:10:01,555
All the books were published in the United Kingdom by Penguin Books.

17
01:14:17,777 --> 01:14:23,777
Four supplementary books, along with graphic novel versions of
the first five books, have also been released.

18
01:18:40,000 --> 01:18:46,000
By January 2022, the books had sold more than 180 million copies
worldwide, making the series one of the best-selling of all time.

19
01:23:02,222 --> 01:23:08,222
A follow-up trilogy in the series, The Senior Year Adventures, takes place after the events
of The Heroes of Olympus and began in 2023 with The Chalice of the Gods.

20
01:27:24,444 --> 01:27:30,444
Three sequel series, The Heroes of Olympus, The Trials of
Apollo, and The Nico di Angelo Adventures, follow.

21
01:31:46,666 --> 01:31:52,666
The first book was adapted as a film titled Percy Jackson &
the Olympians: The Lightning Thief (2010).

22
01:36:08,888 --> 01:36:14,888
It was commercially successful but received mixed reviews from
critics and the audience for its departure from the book.

23
01:40:31,111 --> 01:40:37,111
The first book was also adapted into a musical.

24
01:44:53,333 --> 01:44:59,333
The second book was adapted as a film titled Percy Jackson: Sea of
Monsters (2013), which also received mixed reviews.

25
01:49:15,555 --> 01:49:21,555
A TV series based on the novels premiered on
Disney+ in 2023 to positive reviews.

26
01:53:37,777 --> 01:53:43,777
The film explores themes of monster, based on novel or
book, greek mythology, dyslexia, god.
